<title>MEXICO: Soriana 1997 Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Soriana 1997 Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Oper Income	156.68 million		129.07 million</p>
<p>	Net		  183.29 million		159.41 million</p>
<p>	Revs		  2.381 bln		 2.050 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain    59.91 million		 63.37 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Soriana SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
